# 
# Out on the ice, a chipmunk is frozen in up to the shoulders and
# talking about it. He works through a list of things to say, and the
# list turns over one place each time: the front one is spoken and the
# back one comes round to the front. Leaning in to look is the first
# turn, so two more make three, and after three `#pullMyFinger` is
# lying second -- which is the one arrangement `pullOnChippy` will
# take the joke on.
