# 
# A rubber duck sits on the wing of the garage. Squeeze it and the car
# comes out to meet you.
pointer
# Getting in brings the chipmunk with you -- `chippyHopsIn` is asked
# for by the door, not by the duck.
forward
# 
# The tracks are a hub with three trunk lines off it, and each of
# those has three spurs. Set off down the main line first.
pointer
# 
# The middle line, and then the middle spur off it, is a ramp the car
# does not make. It is worth taking once: it is the one stretch with
# the chipmunk in the film, and he has something to say about the
# driving afterwards.
forward
forward
forward
forward
# Back where it started, on montage 3 -- which is the state the
# windscreen hotspot is guarded on, so the only thing left is to set
# off again.
pointer
# 
# The left-hand line this time, and the middle spur off that, which
# is the one that passes under the anchor.
left
forward
forward
# 
# And that is the chapter. With the boat forward and the teddy hanging
# on the anchor the film is `CM_teddyRescue`: the car catches him, the
# door opens, and it drives out through the exit and home.
forward
# His flags go back in the freezer on the way out, so there is nothing
# left to read for the teddy; the room is the proof.
